{"vid":"GDBH3-JAFk8","source":"GDBH3-JAFk8.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Let's take a look at some sample"},{"t":1.2,"txt":"questions and some ideal responses."},{"t":3.7,"txt":"Question number one."},{"t":5.3,"txt":"Tell me about a time you handled a"},{"t":6.9,"txt":"high-stress situation. This question"},{"t":9.5,"txt":"helps employers understand how you"},{"t":11.2,"txt":"respond under pressure because in"},{"t":13.2,"txt":"nursing, high-stress situations aren't"},{"t":15.7,"txt":"the exception, they're just a regular"},{"t":17.3,"txt":"Tuesday. During a particularly busy"},{"t":19.6,"txt":"shift, we had multiple admissions arrive"},{"t":21.9,"txt":"at once. I focused on triaging patients"},{"t":24.6,"txt":"based on urgency, communicated clearly"},{"t":27.1,"txt":"with my team, and made sure everyone"},{"t":29.2,"txt":"knew their role. By staying calm and"},{"t":31.6,"txt":"organized, we were able to deliver safe,"},{"t":33.5,"txt":"timely care without compromising patient"},{"t":35.7,"txt":"experience. Notice what works here. Calm"},{"t":39,"txt":"tone, teamwork, and patient safety front"},{"t":42.8,"txt":"and center. If you need help framing"},{"t":44.5,"txt":"your answers, a simple but effective"},{"t":46.6,"txt":"method is the STAR method: situation,"},{"t":49.8,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":50,"txt":">> task, action, result. Check out our"},{"t":53.6,"txt":"video on STAR to chart a course to"},{"t":55.7,"txt":"better interview answers. Question"},{"t":57.6,"txt":"number two. How do you prevent burnout?"},{"t":60.3,"txt":"According to Indeed, burnout awareness"},{"t":62.5,"txt":"is increasingly important in nursing"},{"t":64.2,"txt":"interviews because retention matters"},{"t":66.3,"txt":"just as much as skill. I'm proactive"},{"t":68.1,"txt":"[music] about managing stress. I"},{"t":70.3,"txt":"prioritize recovery outside of work"},{"t":72.5,"txt":"using tools like mindfulness techniques"},{"t":74.8,"txt":"and maintaining boundaries around my"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"schedule. I make sure to speak up for"},{"t":78.7,"txt":"support when needed and communicate"},{"t":81,"txt":"early if I'm feeling stretched. I've"},{"t":83.2,"txt":"learned that taking care of myself helps"},{"t":85,"txt":"me provide better care to my patients"},{"t":87,"txt":"and be a stronger teammate. This shows"},{"t":89.4,"txt":"emotional intelligence, and that's a"},{"t":91.8,"txt":"major plus. Burnout is real, especially"},{"t":95,"txt":"in the nursing field. So, honesty is"},{"t":97.6,"txt":"crucial, but be sure to keep the focus"},{"t":100,"txt":"on [music] solutions, not just venting."},{"t":102.5,"txt":"The goal is to work with your manager or"},{"t":104.6,"txt":"team to prevent burnout from happening"},{"t":106.5,"txt":"in the first place. Question number"},{"t":108.5,"txt":"three. Describe a time you advocated for"},{"t":111,"txt":"a patient. This question gets at"},{"t":113.3,"txt":"judgment, confidence, and ethics."},{"t":116.4,"txt":"I remember once I noticed a patient's"},{"t":118.2,"txt":"symptoms weren't aligning with their"},{"t":119.9,"txt":"care plan and assumed someone more"},{"t":122.2,"txt":"senior would catch it. Luckily, they"},{"t":124.2,"txt":"did, but I realized the importance of"},{"t":126.6,"txt":"clearly communicating my observations."},{"t":129.1,"txt":"We're a team, after all. Since then,"},{"t":131.7,"txt":"I've been vocal when it counts and even"},{"t":133.7,"txt":"recently had a patient who improved"},{"t":135.4,"txt":"faster as a result of me sharing and the"},{"t":137.9,"txt":"team adjusting the treatment plan. It"},{"t":139.8,"txt":"really reinforced how important it is to"},{"t":141.7,"txt":"speak up. Why would you admit to a"},{"t":143.9,"txt":"mix-up on the job? Two reasons. One,"},{"t":147.2,"txt":"hiring managers trust candidates who"},{"t":149.1,"txt":"show self-awareness. Two, it shows your"},{"t":152,"txt":"ability to reflect [music] and improve."},{"t":154.6,"txt":"Spoiler alert, everyone makes mistakes,"},{"t":157.2,"txt":"but the best candidates show an ability"},{"t":159,"txt":"to improve with each learning"},{"t":160.5,"txt":"opportunity. Not that you need me to"},{"t":162.4,"txt":"tell you, but preparation matters."},{"t":164.9,"txt":"Here's how to get interview ready as a"},{"t":166.5,"txt":"nurse. Practice answers that show"},{"t":168.8,"txt":"empathy, teamwork, and accountability"},{"t":172,"txt":"because those skills are just as"},{"t":174.1,"txt":"critical as clinical knowledge and"},{"t":176,"txt":"they're often what hiring teams remember"},{"t":177.8,"txt":"the most. Strong candidates ask strong"},{"t":180.6,"txt":"questions."},{"t":181.4,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":181.6,"txt":">> Here are three that Indeed recommends"},{"t":183.7,"txt":"and why they matter. Number one, what"},{"t":186.6,"txt":"development training or continuing"},{"t":188.2,"txt":"education do you offer nurses? This"},{"t":190.6,"txt":"shows that you're invested in growth and"},{"t":192.4,"txt":"long-term impact, not just landing the"},{"t":194.5,"txt":"job. Number two, [music] what are some"},{"t":196.7,"txt":"major challenges nurses currently face"},{"t":198.8,"txt":"in this unit? This helps you prepare"},{"t":201.1,"txt":"realistically. This question tells"},{"t":203.3,"txt":"interviewers you want to contribute from"},{"t":205.2,"txt":"day one and signals [music] that you're"},{"t":207.5,"txt":"ready to be a part of the solution. And"},{"t":209.7,"txt":"number three, what are [music] the best"},{"t":211.3,"txt":"things I can do to succeed in this unit?"},{"t":214,"txt":"This question tells interviewers you"},{"t":215.8,"txt":"want to contribute from day one. So, in"},{"t":218.5,"txt":"summary, [music]"},{"t":219.3,"txt":"let's review what actually makes a nurse"},{"t":221.2,"txt":"stand out during an interview. Bonus"},{"t":223.4,"txt":"points if you can remember all of them."},{"t":225.9,"txt":"Clinical competence, emotional"},{"t":228.3,"txt":"intelligence, clear communication,"},{"t":231.5,"txt":"adaptability, [music]"},{"t":233,"txt":"and team collaboration."},{"t":235.1,"txt":"Being a nurse means balancing skills"},{"t":237.8,"txt":"with compassion, confidence with"},{"t":239.9,"txt":"humility, and pressure with purpose."},{"t":243.3,"txt":"Prepare your stories, ask the right"},{"t":245.8,"txt":"questions, and remember you're"},{"t":248.2,"txt":"interviewing them, too. For more"},{"t":250.2,"txt":"interview tips and career advice, search"},{"t":252.6,"txt":"Indeed on YouTube."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Let's"},{"t":0.2,"w":"take"},{"t":0.36,"w":"a"},{"t":0.44,"w":"look"},{"t":0.6,"w":"at"},{"t":0.68,"w":"some"},{"t":0.84,"w":"sample"},{"t":1.16,"w":"questions"},{"t":1.84,"w":"and"},{"t":2.16,"w":"some"},{"t":2.32,"w":"ideal"},{"t":2.68,"w":"responses."},{"t":3.68,"w":"Question"},{"t":4.08,"w":"number"},{"t":4.32,"w":"one."},{"t":5.28,"w":"Tell"},{"t":5.48,"w":"me"},{"t":5.56,"w":"about"},{"t":5.8,"w":"a"},{"t":5.84,"w":"time"},{"t":6.32,"w":"you"},{"t":6.44,"w":"handled"},{"t":6.8,"w":"a"},{"t":6.88,"w":"high-stress"},{"t":7.68,"w":"situation."},{"t":8.72,"w":"This"},{"t":8.96,"w":"question"},{"t":9.52,"w":"helps"},{"t":9.76,"w":"employers"},{"t":10.28,"w":"understand"},{"t":10.84,"w":"how"},{"t":11.04,"w":"you"},{"t":11.16,"w":"respond"},{"t":11.68,"w":"under"},{"t":11.92,"w":"pressure"},{"t":12.72,"w":"because"},{"t":13.04,"w":"in"},{"t":13.16,"w":"nursing,"},{"t":14.12,"w":"high-stress"},{"t":14.56,"w":"situations"},{"t":15.44,"w":"aren't"},{"t":15.72,"w":"the"},{"t":15.8,"w":"exception,"},{"t":16.56,"w":"they're"},{"t":16.68,"w":"just"},{"t":16.92,"w":"a"},{"t":16.96,"w":"regular"},{"t":17.32,"w":"Tuesday."},{"t":18.24,"w":"During"},{"t":18.56,"w":"a"},{"t":18.64,"w":"particularly"},{"t":19.32,"w":"busy"},{"t":19.64,"w":"shift,"},{"t":20.36,"w":"we"},{"t":20.44,"w":"had"},{"t":20.6,"w":"multiple"},{"t":21,"w":"admissions"},{"t":21.52,"w":"arrive"},{"t":21.88,"w":"at"},{"t":22,"w":"once."},{"t":22.84,"w":"I"},{"t":22.96,"w":"focused"},{"t"